SY_TALK("_948DG_sVp0",[[2,["We have gathered here on the occassion of Ram Navami"]],[7,["and everybody has said"]],[8,["that, \"Mother please tell us about Shri Rama\"."]],[14,["As you know that Shri Rama has taken"]],[19,["a very important place in our chakras."]],[24,["He is seated on our right heart."]],[31,["Shri Rama"]],[35,["represents the place of the father (right heart),"]],[40,["so lack of father's responsibility"]],[46,["or father's love"]],[50,["can cause a catch of this chakra."]],[57,["In Sahaja Yoga we can understand that Rama"]],[63,["and all other Gods"]],[69,["came on earth as different manifestations of divine energy (shakti);"]],[75,["they came to do their jobs."]],[78,["In that sense Shri Rama has a special job."]],[85,["Like Socrates has said benevolent king has to come."]],[90,["As a reflection of that Shri Rama came."]],[96,["Shri Rama came in complete human form"]],[101,["He even forgot that he is a incarnation of Shri Vishnu."]],[106,["He was made to forget this."]],[109,["However for the world"]],[113,["He was Purushottam (Ideal human being)."]],[119,["You all must have heard of his qualities and his childhood"]],[128,["In Sahaja yoga we should understand"]],[134,["that when we worship any of the Gods,"]],[140,["when we consider them as our ideal,"]],[144,["then which qualities we can gain from them,"]],[151,["which qualities we have received?"]],[154,["Shri Rama has many noble qualities."]],[157,["One quality was that He was Purushotam (ideal),"]],[160,["another was how He ruled as a king."]],[168,["He kept his people's opinions higher than Himself,"]],[173,["higher than his wife and children."]],[178,["In the present time,"]],[186,["if people and politicians understand this point,"]],[190,["they wouldn't be called as selfish,"]],[195,["they wouldn't be selfish,"]],[197,["they would be followers of Dharma."]],[199,["However, none has tried to adopt Shri Rama as a role model till now."]],[208,["On the other hand, they will sing His bhajans"]],[211,["or in his name build large organisations and temples."]],[219,["By doing all this, has Shri Rama come in the hearts of these people?"]],[224,["Can you get His light in your life?"]],[228,["Only Sahaja Yogis can do this"]],[230,["that is to bring the light of Shri Rama into their attention."]],[239,["He is totally without any attachments."]],[242,["As it is, all the deities are free from sins and punyas(good deeds),"]],[247,["Whatever we deem as a sin"]],[250,["if they do, is not a sin."]],[253,["For example, Shri Krishna killed many people,"]],[256,["Shri Rama killed Ravana."]],[259,["It can be considered a sin in worldly sense"]],[266,["but not in the eyes of God."]],[269,["Because they destroy evil people and remove evils"]],[274,["and they have the right to do whatever is needed for this purpose."]],[281,["Like when Shri Devi slayed rakshasas, She killed the demons."]],[286,["Some people may ask if She has committed a sin."]],[289,["However Her responsibility is to destroy the rakshasas"]],[294,["and protect the saints."]],[301,["In Shri Rama's life Ahilya's redemption is the most important event."]],[307,["He reedemed Ahilya."]],[310,["She was cursed by her husband."]],[315,["In those times if any women goes out of dharma,"]],[320,["and if her husband was a saint of high stature,"]],[324,["he could curse her."]],[327,["But Ahillya was blamed falsely."]],[332,["and false allegations were made."]],[335,["And she was made into stone."]],[337,["So Shri Rama saved Ahilya."]],[342,["Particularly His attitude towards His wife,"]],[351,["His love for Her,"]],[353,["His commitment to having only one wife"]],[359,["is something to be really understood."]],[362,["Even though He knew that Sitaji was the incarnation of Shri Mahalaxmi"]],[367,["She Herself was a Devi."]],[369,["But in His human form"]],[372,["He never raised His eyes to look at any other women but his wife."]],[378,["When we talk about Shri Rama"]],[381,["the husband like qualities inside us should be pure."]],[387,["When any lady thinks about Shri Rama"]],[392,["she should have the same faith in her husband"]],[396,["like Shri Sita had in Her husband."]],[399,["Similarly, husbands also need to adopt the quality of Shri Rama"]],[403,["of being devoted to their one wife."]],[405,["This is not difficult for Sahaja Yogis."]],[408,["Women should be respected. Have respect for your wife!"]],[413,["Although Ravana kidnapped Sitaji"]],[417,["Shri Rama felt it is His duty to rescue Her."]],[422,["But in His kingdom it was His duty to follow the will of the people"]],[426,["and He had so much balance"]],[428,["that Shri Sita only for whom He woeked hard to rescue"]],[433,["He left Her because of the will of the people."]],[436,["As Sitaji Herself was the Goddess,"]],[439,["this had no particular impact on Her,"]],[442,["it had no consequence."]],[445,["So Shri Rama sacrificied Her."]],[447,["People talk about such things which are not in public interest."]],[453,["Being their ideal, He did not want them to think that He condoned"]],[457,["keeping the company of women whose character is under doubt."]],[464,["Although She was the unblemishable Devi (Nishkalanka),"]],[467,["She was the embodiment of the purity of the Devi,"]],[469,["when He left Her, in one way She left Him too."]],[474,["She left Him in a manner a woman would do"]],[478,["and Shri Rama as a man would do."]],[481,["Sitaji disappeared into the Mother Earth"]],[483,["and then in the end Shri Rama went into River Sarayu."]],[489,["Their life was very eventful and full of miracles."]],[496,["In their whole life you can see how Shri Sita and Shri Rama"]],[499,["had respect and were faithful to each other."]],[505,["Even though Shri Rama left Shri Sita,"]],[508,["She understood that it was His royal duty,"]],[512,["and She never complained or talked ill of Him."]],[516,["And effortlessly She raised Her children,"]],[521,["and made them flourish and develop."]],[525,["Shri Rama's two children are called Luv and Kush."]],[530,["They came like devotees"]],[534,["and in this world we can see them as the ideal disciples."]],[539,["They represent the disciple principle"]],[541,["and for us they are the power of disciplehood"]],[547,["with which we can become disciple of someone."]],[550,["As disciples they learned archery at a very young age."]],[557,["In their young age they learned Ramayana"]],[560,["and got proficiency in music."]],[564,["It means that the disciples must surrender completely to their guru."]],[572,["We also have the qualities of a disciple innately within us."]],[576,["They were completely surrendered to their Mother, who was Shakti."]],[584,["Even they were about to fight against Shri Rama for their Mother,"]],[590,["so they kept their Mother as the highest in the world."]],[593,["The Mother also cared for them,"]],[596,["nurtured them and made them stand on dharma."]],[600,["To make them progress was Her foremost priority and duty."]],[603,["Not like today's wives who would have cried:"]],[606,["\"My husband left me, my husband has left me\"."]],[608,["But when they get a husband they will fight all the time"]],[611,["and when the husband leaves them then they will cry."]],[614,["Unlike Sitaji who felt: \"If He has left Me, no problem."]],[617,["These are My children, I will take care of them."]],[620,["And nothing should happen that deprive them of anything\"."]],[628,["Shri Sita's bravery and fortitude"]],[634,["were the special qualities seen in Her life."]],[638,["Every lady must imbibe these qualities."]],[640,["Even if you are separated from your husband"]],[643,["and you are not longer together,"]],[646,["even then, because of your husband,"]],[649,["you should not let that create a loss for you or your children."]],[653,["Because your duty is the most important thing."]],[659,["You should not give up this most important thing."]],[662,["All Sahaja Yoginis should try to get this power of Shakti."]],[670,["Shri Rama's life was also very pure and spotless (nirmal)"]],[674,["and He gave up everything for His wife."]],[678,["When his wife was exiled to the forest,"]],[684,["and He had to live alone,"]],[686,["and when He sacrificed Her,"]],[690,["He gave up all the comforts of the royal life."]],[694,["You know He used to sleep on the grass, on the floor"]],[699,["walked barefeet and wore clothes like an ascetic."]],[705,["All these are not stories This is the truth,"]],[709,["In our world, in India, many people were born"]],[713,["whose life had a high standard of morals"]],[717,["and they never thought about small or low level things."]],[720,["But all these ideal people of our country"]],[724,["have become superfluous over time."]],[730,["We think that Shri Rama is ours, we are His devotees"]],[733,["and we can attain Him by only singing bhajans to Him."]],[736,["We have developed a kind of hypocrisy."]],[740,["In other countries where they do not have such models (like Shri Rama)"]],[743,["the people there try to correct themselves."]],[747,["They try to make themselves ok."]],[749,["Because you have a model like Shri Ram"]],[751,["you say you can never become like Him,"]],[754,["or like Shri Krishna."]],[756,["We feel they became models,"]],[758,["but we are not able to relate with Them."]],[760,["We get feelings like that."]],[763,["But if we have Shri Rama inside,"]],[766,["His light can certainly come in our attention."]],[770,["Why cannot it come? Why should we not attain this?"]],[773,["Why should we not try to learn about the circumstances"]],[776,["around which Shri Rama came on this earth?"]],[779,["A Sahaja Yogi must consider this -"]],[782,["if we can attain Shri Rama's spiritual state,"]],[784,["then all our political problems will be resolved,"]],[788,["all our problems will be over."]],[792,["This will happen the day Sahay Yogis resolve in their heart"]],[795,["that they would like to become like Shri Rama."]],[797,["In our country, where Shri Ram ruled,"]],[801,["He conducted His rule in a selfless state"]],[807,["and in a state of enlightment."]],[812,["And He desired all good qualities should come in His people."]],[816,["And He wanted that firstly His people to become dharmic,"]],[819,["get educated and evolved."]],[822,["He wanted many high ideals should be established in them."]],[827,["This He tried to do all the time."]],[831,["And for this He made His life very idealistic (for others to follow)."]],[835,["Just think, if someone tells you something"]],[839,["but he himself does not follow his own advise"]],[841,["then how can you have faith in such a person?"]],[844,["Therefore you cannot get the qualities."]],[847,["However, many people say, \"We follow this person or that person\"."]],[850,["But in reality, they are just the opposite of whom they follow."]],[853,["Followers of Ram seems to be the most corrupt politicians possible?"]],[857,["or they have more than ten wives."]],[859,["How can they say they follow Shri Rama?"]],[863,["What is the duty of a Sahaja Yogi in his life?"]],[869,["We also have to bring the light of the Gods in our attention."]],[874,["For every situation we must think: \"What would Shri Rama have done?\""]],[880,["If such a question arose then what woud Shri Rama have replied."]],[884,["If such a question arose then what woud Shri Sita have replied."]],[888,["What would Sita ji say?"]],[890,["How would Shri Sita behave?"]],[892,["If any lady thinks like that"]],[894,["she would certainly become the Gruhlaxmi of her house."]],[898,["As you Sahaja Yogis know, Sitaji took many births after that."]],[903,["And She came as incarnation of Gruhlaxmi as Fatima-bi."]],[909,["She used to stay at home under a veil,"]],[912,["but all dharma was done by Her power."]],[916,["Not necessary for you to go out and give big lectures"]],[920,["or become a leader. There is no need."]],[923,["You can do this work from home,"]],[926,["you can spread Sahaja Yoga to your children, relatives and friends."]],[935,["But at first you should attain this (Sahaja Yoga)."]],[937,["After all this work is done, you can spread it to society."]],[941,["After that you can go elsewhere to spread it, if you want."]],[945,["But first ladies should have pure character like Sitaji."]],[952,["First reflection of this purity is a strong maternal feeling of love."]],[956,["When She was exiled in the jungle along with Her husband"]],[959,["She never complained that, \"My husband doesn't earn, He doesn't earn."]],[963,["Just like the women here complain,"]],[965,["\"He doesn't do this, he doesn't buy this or that\"."]],[968,["If he is in jungle, then so am I."]],[971,["Whatever he will eat, I will also eat."]],[973,["Will I eat before he eats?"]],[976,["Shri Sita would not have done that."]],[977,["Let me serve him first and then the brother in law, let them finish"]],[981,["then I will eat."]],[983,["Nowadays women think there is too much..."]],[989,["there is too much pressure of the work on them."]],[995,["But it is not so."]],[997,["A woman is like earth element."]],[1000,["She has so much power that she can absorb a lot of pressure."]],[1004,["So much is being given by the earth: flowers, fruit, leaves etc."]],[1009,["In the same manner, women are like the earth element."]],[1013,["We have got so many powers that we can absorb everything inside."]],[1018,["and shower the rain of love which is inside us."]],[1022,["God has given us this power."]],[1025,["So if you have this power -"]],[1027,["for example if this fan is moving, it is due to the electricity."]],[1031,["Then which one is greater, the electricity or the fan?"]],[1036,["If you think the fan is greater because it is moving"]],[1041,["then you are under an illusion."]],[1043,["The manifestation of feminine energy is huge, like an ocean."]],[1047,["With that support men do their work."]],[1052,["This is like potential and kinetic states of energy."]],[1056,["So women are the potential energy and men are the kinetic energy."]],[1060,["But wanting to emulate men, because they can run faster."]],[1063,["women also start running."]],[1065,["There is no need for a woman to do that. She needs to sit."]],[1068,["Roles of both are different"]],[1072,["so each of them need to play their role in solving a problem."]],[1075,["Actually, women can thrive in both activities (potential and kinetic)."]],[1078,["When the time comes women can be more productive than men."]],[1082,["As you may be aware, in Maharashtra there was a widow named Tarabai"]],[1086,["who was 17 years, 17 years only."]],[1089,["She was the younger daughter-in-law of Shivaji"]],[1093,["All lost against Aurangzeb and she defeated him at only 17 years."]],[1098,["and built his grave in a place called Aurangabad."]],[1101,["You can understand today"]],[1103,["that if a woman is able to concentrate all her powers."]],[1108,["Like it is said that when her powers are in a manifested state,"]],[1112,["then she can become fierce (prachand)."]],[1115,["But if she wastes or fritters away her powers"]],[1121,["by wasting it in fighting, arguing, complaining or in frivolous things,"]],[1127,["then her power is completely destroyed."]],[1130,["Women are so powerful"]],[1133,["that if they want, they can work more than men."]],[1138,["However, first of all, they must respect their powers."]],[1142,["By throwing her powers here and there, by destroying her powers,"]],[1146,["she becomes powerless."]],[1148,["These powerless women are of no use to anyone."]],[1151,["Therefore, the woman's role"]],[1154,["is of utmost importance and full of dignity."]],[1156,["Women should therefore be very modest and very wise."]],[1163,["For example, sometimes men use swear words but real women do not."]],[1168,["You might have seen that men argue and can even have physical fights."]],[1171,["Let them! But women do not do that."]],[1174,["Their job is to emit peace,"]],[1177,["their job is to give protection"]],[1179,["and their job is to save everyone."]],[1182,["For example, there is a shield."]],[1185,["A shield cannot function as a sword"]],[1187,["and a sword cannot function as a shield."]],[1190,["So is the shield more important or the sword?"]],[1193,["Obviously the shield, as it can withstand the attack of the sword."]],[1197,["Sometimes the sword may even break but not the shield."]],[1200,["So women must be engulfed in their power."]],[1204,["And the main lever for manifesting this strength"]],[1207,["is the power of humility."]],[1210,["With humility we should establish these powers within us."]],[1214,["This work is not difficult for Sahaja Yogis."]],[1217,["For Sahaja Yogis this is not difficult at all."]],[1219,["I see many Sahaja Yoginis talking so much nonsense."]],[1223,["I don't know why, but anywhere they want to chat non-stop with men."]],[1227,["Once a gentleman came running to Me and said, \"Mother save me, save me!\""]],[1229,["I asked ”What happened?”, He said \"She is after me\"."]],[1231,["I asked, ”Who?”, \"The one who talks a lot.\""]],[1233,["I said, ”The one who talks a lot?”."]],[1234,["He said, \"Yes, save me, I am fed up with her\"."]],[1236,["So he came to hide in My room."]],[1238,["There is no need to excessively talk with men."]],[1242,["What is the need to talk nonsense?"]],[1244,["Amongst women also, no need to talk about unimportant things."]],[1247,["In Sahaja Yoga, I have seen that men make more effort to study."]],[1251,["Women should also do that,"]],[1253,["what is Sahaja Yoga and what chakras there are,"]],[1255,["which chakra have what impact,"]],[1258,["which chakra causes which problem."]],[1261,["They should have full knowledge of this."]],[1263,["If only men learn this knowledge, then women will be left behind."]],[1267,["Women must learn all this."]],[1269,["Now for men, Shri Rama is their role model."]],[1275,["I feel in a way, Muslims have played a good role for us."]],[1281,["I do not criticize them. This problem is not in their country."]],[1285,["Say if you go to Riyad,"]],[1287,["no Muslim will stare at you."]],[1290,["I have not seem anyone doing that."]],[1291,["If there is a lady, they will give her respect."]],[1294,["If any lady is crossing the street,"]],[1296,["they will stop the car out of respect."]],[1298,["There is so much respect for women there."]],[1300,["But here in India, I do not understand why,"]],[1303,["the impact of the muslim culture has been the opposite."]],[1305,["that we see women as an object to be exploited."]],[1310,["They want to see every woman in their path,"]],[1311,["twisting the neck but continue staring."]],[1315,["It is a big sin to stare at every woman."]],[1319,["In Sahaja Yoga, it is considered as an prohibited act."]],[1322,["Absolutely prohibited."]],[1323,["Firstly you will spoil your eyes."]],[1326,["And being in Sahaja Yoga it will cause even more damage."]],[1328,["If more damage does not happen, then you may even become blind."]],[1333,["Sometimes I see people have wandering eyes."]],[1337,["They are talking to someone but eyes are wandering elsewhere."]],[1340,["Nowadays, even women too are learning this."]],[1342,["The biggest loss by doing this is your attention."]],[1347,["If your attention goes here and there,"]],[1350,["if your attention goes here and there,"]],[1353,["then what's the use of Self-Realization?"]],[1355,["Because without focussing attention"]],[1359,["it can't become active."]],[1361,["Focussed attention can only become active."]],[1364,["A focussed attention must be attained."]],[1366,["In the west, this disease is more among men."]],[1369,["It's there in women also but not as much as in the men."]],[1371,["So the western yogis asked me the cure for this disease."]],[1374,["They are not like Indians, they do not think this is good thing."]],[1377,["They consider it a negative thing."]],[1379,["Since they came to Sahaj Yoga, they are asking Me to remove it."]],[1381,["I told them to look only at the ground"]],[1385,["and up to 3 feet on top."]],[1388,["You have no need to see above that."]],[1391,["Look at the ground while walking."]],[1392,["So you will recognise Sahaja Yogis anywhere in the world."]],[1396,["They are the ones walking with their eyes lowered."]],[1399,["You see all good things below 3 feet, such as flowers and children."]],[1404,["Nothing good to see above."]],[1409,["So, that's how you should control your attention."]],[1413,["Now Shri Rama did not need to do this."]],[1415,["However, if you have respect towards Shri Rama,"]],[1418,["you must control your attention like Him."]],[1423,["Explain to your wife,"]],[1429,["that she is a shakti and you respect that quality."]],[1431,["But she must also prove herself worthy of this respect."]],[1435,["Like the shloka: \"Yatra nāryastu pūjyanté ramanté tatra devatāḥ\" -"]],[1439,["\"Where women are worshipped, in such places do Gods reside.\""]],[1444,["But those women must also be worth respecting."]],[1450,["[to audience] What is it? Please sit down."]],[1454,["Ok, sit down. One should not move around during the Puja."]],[1458,["So if the woman is to be worshipped,"]],[1462,["she needs to be worthy of worship."]],[1464,["Who would worship a dirty woman?"]],[1467,["Who would worship a cruel woman?"]],[1469,["Or someone with a demonic temperament? Will anyone worship?"]],[1472,["Only those who are worth of worship"]],[1475,["should be worshipped"]],[1478,["and only in that place God would reside as well."]],[1480,["Firstly, men should realise"]],[1482,["that this lady is the mother of their children."]],[1486,["If husband scolds or mocks his wife in front of children,"]],[1490,["gives her no respect,"]],[1492,["then children will never respect their mother."]],[1494,["Think of it as a relationship"]],[1496,["between a prime minister and a deputy prime minister."]],[1499,["Women should not insult their husbands as well."]],[1502,["Like the delegation of authority from prime minister (father)"]],[1505,["to deputy (mother),"]],[1507,["it can be wrongly delegated to children by the father."]],[1509,["But if the couple are such that they do not have this subtlety,"]],[1515,["then the lady feels she should dominate, the man feels he should."]],[1518,["If woman understand how to handle her man,"]],[1521,["then there would not be any fights."]],[1523,["You should understand that it's very easy to manage men,"]],[1526,["because they are like children."]],[1529,["Its very easy to manage them."]],[1531,["Their temperament is simple, like that of children."]],[1534,["With arguments or by talking a lot, you can't handle them."]],[1538,["You must also forgive them like you forgive children."]],[1541,["They go outside, have fights or arguments and return home stressed."]],[1545,["And then carry this frustration home to the wife."]],[1547,["If they express it outside they will get beaten."]],[1549,["So the wife can sometimes ignore these outbursts."]],[1552,["Until the wife has this attitude towards her husband,"]],[1557,["there cannot be mutual understanding, love and joy between them."]],[1561,["However, the husband should also think about what wife needs"]],[1565,["and what does not."]],[1567,["But this does not mean because she is the wife,"]],[1569,["she can say something wrong or give wrong advise."]],[1572,["In this situation, he must tell her:"]],[1574,["\"This is wrong, I won't do this\"."]],[1576,["\"This is a lie. I won't do that.\""]],[1579,["But no need to fight on small-small matters."]],[1583,["And fighting on trivial issues,"]],[1585,["does not behove a Sahaja Yogi."]],[1588,["I am surprised when Sahaja couples keep on fighting."]],[1592,["They come to complain about each other."]],[1595,["If one Sahaja couple cannot stay peacefully with each other,"]],[1599,["then how can we talk about bringing love to the entire world?"]],[1604,["It will not work out, if you keep fighting like this."]],[1607,["So first thing is, the husband must be fully in a way"]],[1613,["alert to the needs of his wife,"]],[1616,["and know that all the other women in the world,"]],[1620,["are like his sisters and mother."]],[1624,["If this does not manifest even after Sahaja Yoga"]],[1627,["then it cannot happen anywhere else."]],[1629,["There was a gentleman,"]],[1633,["that too a Swiss person and not an Indian."]],[1636,["He was a father of a Sahaja Yogini."]],[1640,["Girl's husband had wandering eyes,"]],[1644,["although he had come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1647,["They both came to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1649,["The girl was a very good, chaste girl."]],[1652,["He continued with this behavior wherever he went."]],[1655,["So her father, who was not a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1657,["told his daughter that it was better to leave him,"]],[1660,["saying that, \"If someone cannot be cleansed even with Sahaja yoga,"]],[1663,["then he can never be cleansed. You leave him\"."]],[1666,["She said \"He has improved slightly.\""]],[1668,["Father replied: \"If he cannot be fully clean,"]],[1671,["he is not a Sahaja Yogi. Leave him and have no relations with him\"."]],[1675,["Even someone who is not a Sahaja Yogi can understand"]],[1680,["that if a person's eyes cannot be stable after Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1684,["if his attention does not become stable,"]],[1687,["then there is something wrong."]],[1690,["Another key feature of our Indian culture"]],[1693,["is that men's and women's circle of social interactions"]],[1696,["should be restricted to brother and sister relationship."]],[1698,["But this does not happen."]],[1700,["I see immeadiately frivolous women"]],[1702,["just falling over to talk to men."]],[1705,["They will chatter on with the men."]],[1708,["I do not understand the need."]],[1711,["They will not sit together with other women but with men."]],[1714,["Same with some men who are engrossed by women."]],[1716,["They see some lady and start pursuing her -"]],[1719,["any woman, even if she is a house maid or anyone else."]],[1723,["Anyone they can reach, they will pursue."]],[1726,["They have no self respect."]],[1730,["They think this is manhood."]],[1732,["but the pinnacle of manhood is Shri Rama."]],[1735,["He is sitting up there, who is the epitome of manhood"]],[1739,["But the people who are at the lowest level,"]],[1741,["they think they represent perfect manhood."]],[1743,["How can this be manhood?"]],[1745,["They should either not worship Shri Rama"]],[1747,["and follow the devil instead,"]],[1749,["or if they actually believe in Shri Rama, they should follow His ideals."]],[1752,["And that is why nowadays, children and women are getting spoiled."]],[1757,["Even then, it's a unique feature of Indian culture"]],[1761,["that women have managed well."]],[1763,["If they were like Americans women,"]],[1765,["then all of you would have been finished."]],[1768,["In America, they have caused trouble"]],[1771,["and the men are in a pitiable state."]],[1773,["I tell you there if a man gets married 2-3 times,"]],[1778,["he is bankrupted"]],[1780,["and if a lady marries 2-3 times,"]],[1782,["she will have the means to build a palace."]],[1786,["So what's good there?"]],[1788,["Children run away from home. What is their social structure?"]],[1790,["So this is a speciality of our Indian women,"]],[1793,["because they have grown up in Indian traditions,"]],[1795,["they manage the house and children well, know their responsibility."]],[1799,["But this is changing."]],[1801,["They say, \"If my husband does like this, so why cannot I\"?"]],[1805,["They ask, \"If he does this to me, why shouldn't I?\"."]],[1808,["If he runs after 10 women, then we go with 15 men."]],[1811,["They say, \"If he is doing bad things and going to hell,"]],[1815,["then I will go before him\"."]],[1817,["Women should not talk like this."]],[1819,["The foundation of dharma is in women's hands."]],[1822,["Women must manage this."]],[1824,["They must bring their husband on the path of dharma"]],[1826,["by explaining and by cajoling him to keep him close."]],[1830,["This is her biggest duty and she has this power in her."]],[1833,["However, if she herself is not dharmic..."]],[1835,["In dharma, the biggest dharma is forgiveness."]],[1838,["If she does not know how to forgive,"]],[1840,["then even if she follows any religion, it will be of no use."]],[1843,["First thing she must have forgiveness."]],[1845,["She should forgive her children, her husband,"]],[1848,["give refuge to people working in the house and everyone else."]],[1851,["This is her duty."]],[1853,["Some challenges come like this."]],[1855,["Now see, this work that I am doing,"]],[1857,["even Shri Rama could not have done it, nor Shri Krishna,"]],[1861,["nor Lord Jesus."]],[1863,["Had it been Shri Rama, he would cut everyone's head off."]],[1869,["He would have killed everyone saying, \"Now you go."]],[1871,["You are useless, adharmic,"]],[1873,["you run after women, you are licentious, hence you go\"."]],[1876,["Do not know how many he would be finished right away?"]],[1880,["Second, if Shri Krishna came, He would have used his sudarshan chakra."]],[1884,["That too would have spoilt the situation."]],[1886,["Had Lord Christ came, He would have allowed Himself to be crucified."]],[1889,["This is very good - go for crucifixion once, work is done."]],[1892,["Better than being crucified everyday."]],[1895,["Only a Mother can do this work."]],[1897,["Only a Mother can do it, because of Her power of love is so strong,"]],[1901,["that anything can be worked out by relying on Her power of love."]],[1906,["She takes up everything"]],[1908,["and her ways are so endearing"]],[1910,["that children do not react negatively on being corrected by her."]],[1912,["Suppose something happens, something goes wrong,"]],[1915,["it's the mother who knows how to handle it."]],[1918,["She may scold the children later."]],[1920,["As they know that mother loves them, scolds them for their benefit"]],[1923,["and hence they do not grudge it."]],[1925,["With father scolding, children may react but not with mother's."]],[1929,["Because her love is without any self-interest."]],[1933,["She does not want anything for herself."]],[1935,["She wants that her children should be good, get all her powers,"]],[1938,["gain everything good that exists inside her."]],[1942,["If a mother has these feelings"]],[1945,["then her children will turn out fine."]],[1947,["But many mothers are very forward, abrasive,"]],[1951,["get involved in everything, will speak on everything."]],[1954,["The poor husband will keep sitting quietly."]],[1957,["while she will be standing in the front."]],[1959,["When this happens, then children will become spoiled."]],[1961,["Growing under such a adverse environment,"]],[1964,["children can grow up to be destructive,"]],[1967,["which can be very harmful."]],[1970,["The lady, being the potential energy, should be behind"]],[1973,["and keep her husband in front."]],[1975,["Its ok. Whatever the husband does,"]],[1977,["the wife must help him from behind."]],[1980,["The source of his power is wife - this you must understand."]],[1985,["Therefore how pure and hard-working the lady needs to be."]],[1989,["You will say that Mother is leaving all the onus on the women."]],[1991,["I do this because I know you are very powerful,"]],[1994,["I know we women have many powers."]],[1996,["Because I am Myself a Mother."]],[1997,["Now see, it's been left to Me to redeem thousands,"]],[2001,["to cure so many diseases."]],[2002,["From morning to evening, I am curing sick people."]],[2005,["After that, give them Realisation. Did anyone work like this?"]],[2007,["Only Ahilya was saved (by Lord Rama) and that was it."]],[2011,["Lord Christ cured in total only about 21 people."]],[2014,["I must have cured 21,000 people by now."]],[2017,["I roam around the planet, doing this or that work for everyone."]],[2023,["It's still going on, but I do not feel it's work,"]],[2025,["because it's the power of love. This power of love runs ahead of Me."]],[2029,["Now, before going outside I think of taking a bandhan,"]],[2033,["as I don't know what kind of people touch My feet."]],[2035,["But I forget doing this."]],[2036,["As soon as a troubled person comes in front of Me,"]],[2039,["I absorb all their problems."]],[2041,["The love is like that - it acts on its own."]],[2044,["I know that it is this love acting and doing all the work."]],[2048,["I do not feel bad about this. Whatever is happening is ok."]],[2051,["There will be some discomfort, let it happen."]],[2053,["All this only a Mother can do."]],[2055,["Therefore, I have my special attention on you,"]],[2059,["that you do work in a peaceful and steady manner."]],[2064,["Also men need to now fully support their women,"]],[2070,["fully understand and respect them."]],[2072,["Until the two wheels of a chariot are of the same size,"]],[2078,["it goes around in circles."]],[2080,["It does not go forward."]],[2083,["They both should be the similar,"]],[2086,["but one is for the left and the other for the right."]],[2090,["The left wheel will not fit on the right side, nor the opposite way."]],[2094,["That is why there are two types of wheel."]],[2096,["These both types of wheel are working well"]],[2100,["because they are alike in some sense"]],[2104,["and not alike in another sense."]],[2108,["Compared to each other"]],[2112,["they are similar in sense of height, length and width"]],[2118,["but they work differently."]],[2122,["Similarly, this happens in our life."]],[2128,["So Shri Ramachandra ji"]],[2130,["did not think only about the husband and wife."]],[2139,["He did not also only think about His children and the dynasty."]],[2145,["He thought about everyone, his brother, sister, mother, father etc.,"]],[2151,["just like a normal human being should."]],[2154,["After that, He thought about society as well."]],[2161,["He thought about the general public,"]],[2163,["about the country,"]],[2165,["and kingdom."]],[2167,["Across His life, in all normal and typical human activities,"]],[2172,["He showed how a human should ideally behave."]],[2178,["The man who loved His wife so much,"]],[2182,["left Her despite knowing that She was completely pure."]],[2189,["Nowadays, they make properties for the wife"]],[2191,["or the wife needs this or that thing or wants to built something."]],[2195,["And if it's said, give 2 paisa to the poor then will not."]],[2200,["Otherwise they give to their childen, nephews etc."]],[2204,["It is a disease among the ruling class."]],[2206,["And Shri Rama, He renounced even such a wife"]],[2210,["who was the incarnation of the Devi and extremely pure."]],[2216,["Then we must re-think about our attachments,"]],[2220,["about our relationships or properties."]],[2223,["And some people are just..."]],[2225,["Previously in the West, husband-wife relation was not good."]],[2228,["After Sahaja Yoga relation is good, but the wife became everything."]],[2232,["In our collective, at least 4-5 leaders had to leave Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2235,["because of their wives."]],[2237,["Because the wife was not good, though the husband was good."]],[2240,["Their wife brainwashed them, leading to their ruin."]],[2244,["At least five yogis went out because of their wives."]],[2249,["So even here I would say, that the wives should understand"]],[2254,["what Sahaja Yoga is"]],[2257,["and what is their place in it."]],[2260,["And the husband too, in such situations,"]],[2263,["should not agree to his wife at all."]],[2266,["Should tell her that, “You talk and run about too much. Be quiet!"]],[2272,["You are of no use. Your chakras are not alright\"."]],[2275,["When the husband responds to her like that,"]],[2279,["only then will she become alright."]],[2280,["Instead you accept to spoil your chakras, if she spoils hers."]],[2284,["If she says, \"Do this\", then you do that."]],[2287,["If she tells you to steal money, then you do it."]],[2290,["Even after coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2292,["your subtle catches still stick on."]],[2295,["In this you must give full attention."]],[2298,["On the occasion of Shri Rama today,"]],[2300,["we must reflect on Shri Hanuman,"]],[2303,["how He was so devoted to Shri Rama"]],[2309,["and how He was busy at His service and disposal."]],[2314,["And being all the time at Shri Rama's service,"]],[2318,["He knew that His entire life would have significance."]],[2326,["We should also adopt Shri Hanuman's wisdom in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2333,["This does not mean"]],[2335,["that you keep on cooking and sending food for Me. Absolutely not."]],[2338,["Because I hardly eat anything"]],[2340,["and by cooking too much, you put Me in a difficult situation."]],[2344,["One person sends some dish, another something else."]],[2346,["Like it is said that food should be offered to God first,"]],[2349,["but for a God who does not eat, why trouble Her with food?"]],[2352,["Food is not needed. Nothing is needed."]],[2354,["What is required is a commitment to serve without any delay."]],[2358,["Did Shri Hanuman ever cook and send food to Shri Rama?"]],[2362,["Delhi people have bothered Me so much cooking for Me all the time,"]],[2365,["that I have stipulated"]],[2367,["that if they cook anymore, I would not come to Delhi."]],[2372,["Do what is required."]],[2375,["It is useless to force food on someone who does not eat."]],[2379,["Or for someone without any needs, getting bangles or something else."]],[2383,["Your Mother does not need anything."]],[2385,["My house is full. I am troubled by all this."]],[2387,["I say that get only flowers and nothing else."]],[2390,["I need nothing. Flowers are enough."]],[2392,["And decoration with flowers should not be of thousands rupees."]],[2395,["Today you have decorated flowers modestly, not too much."]],[2398,["Sometimes I'm worried with how many flowers you put on the stage."]],[2402,["So do things in balance, so that your Mother will appreciate it."]],[2406,["Your Mother is simple. She has no appreciation for these things."]],[2411,["So I want to emphasise, that you need to learn from Shri Hanuman,"]],[2417,["to find contentment in serving."]],[2419,["So what service is specifically needed?"]],[2421,["I need no special service."]],[2424,["I am healthy and need not much service."]],[2427,["However, if you want to serve Me, then do service to Sahaja Yoga."]],[2432,["Whoever will be serving in Sahaja Yoga, will be serving Me."]],[2436,["How many people have you given Realisation?"]],[2438,["How many women have you given Realisation to?"]],[2441,["How many did you transform? How many did you take interest in?"]],[2444,["Whenever someone new comes to the program"]],[2446,["yogis say, \"You have this or that possession\", they get after him."]],[2450,["So he runs away."]],[2451,["I asked a gentleman, \"You got your Realisation. Why did you leave?\""]],[2455,["He said that after the program,"]],[2456,["yogis told him he had three possessions inside."]],[2461,["He was even told the number of bhoots."]],[2466,["I asked him why did he believe the yogi?"]],[2468,["He said that he seemed like an authority"]],[2470,["and came running to tell him that he had three possessions."]],[2474,["I do not know who said that to him, but the newcomer ran away."]],[2477,["So in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2480,["what we need to learn from Shri Hanuman is His eagerness."]],[2484,["\"Ram kaj karne ko tatpar\" (eager to do Shri Rama's work)."]],[2488,["What is our kaj (work)?"]],[2490,["\"My work is Sahaja Yoga."]],[2492,["My work is Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2495,["to raise the Kundalini, to give Realisation to people,"]],[2498,["to get peace and love in them,"]],[2502,["to talk about love."]],[2507,["explaining about all chakras etc. in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2513,["whatever they need - to explain that\"."]],[2515,["Now when I said this, people started giving long lectures."]],[2518,["Some people started giving so many lectures"]],[2522,["that I had to tell them to stop"]],[2526,["otherwise the other yogis will be finished."]],[2528,["People complained that they lecture for 2 hours."]],[2531,["There is no time to hear Your talk and do Aarti."]],[2534,["We have to go home just with this."]],[2536,["So I had that person's lecture stopped."]],[2538,["He said that when I go then he doesn't know what happens to him."]],[2541,["He told Me, \"I feel like giving a lecture. How can I correct this?\"."]],[2545,["I told him, \"You put supari (betel nut) in your mouth.\""]],[2548,["\"How large the nut should be?\" - he asked Me."]],[2553,["I said, \"It depends on the size of your mouth."]],[2557,["If you do not even know how big should be the betel nut,"]],[2560,["then what do you talk about Sahaja Yoga?"]],[2563,["You do not have this wisdom either\"."]],[2566,["People like talking a lot in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2569,["They think they have got a platform to give lectures."]],[2572,["They have got the mike and want to speak. Cannot leave the mike."]],[2576,["Once they got hold of the mic they cannot leave it."]],[2578,["This is a new disease."]],[2582,["So you must understand, \"Why to give a lecture?"]],[2586,["There are so many of Mother's lectures, listen to those only\"."]],[2588,["So whenever you have a function,"]],[2591,["display a video of Mine"]],[2595,["or play My tapes."]],[2597,["Give pencil and paper to people, after, to write their questions."]],[2603,["Then you give them Realisation"]],[2606,["and ask them to write any of their problems and bring it next time,"]],[2610,["any problem in the beginning like someone is sick or in trouble."]],[2615,["Now there are also people like this -"]],[2617,["there is one person, he would even come to Calcutta to cure someone."]],[2621,["Now he will go..."]],[2624,["Now people are inviting him to come to Russia to cure people."]],[2629,["One person only is running from here to there like Shri Hanuman."]],[2633,["All of you can cure."]],[2635,["All of you can cure everyone."]],[2638,["All women can do it, all men can do it as well,"]],[2640,["but no one tries."]],[2642,["By giving lectures how many have been cured?"]],[2647,["I don't know why there is only one person in India"]],[2651,["who can cure people,"]],[2652,["while in London there are 15-20 people who can cure"]],[2657,["and there are in France as well."]],[2660,["One should learn the technique to clear people."]],[2663,["Take a bandhan and do it."]],[2666,["For this, will you call people from outside?"]],[2669,["For what purpose are you a Sahaja Yogi?"]],[2671,["You roam around wearing a badge of Sahaja Yoga but cannot even cure."]],[2675,["Then, remove the badge."]],[2677,["You cannot even clear yourself or cure your diseases,"]],[2680,["so how will you cure others?"]],[2682,["I must tell you that everybody has got all the power to cure anyone."]],[2688,["You must learn this. You must master it."]],[2691,["Instead of inviting someone to Calcutta,"]],[2694,["people from Calcutta should go out to cure."]],[2697,["It's a matter of a little courage. Nohting will happen to you."]],[2700,["Neither can you get sick or anything else can happen."]],[2703,["The more you work in Sahaja Yoga, the deeper you will become."]],[2706,["Because the wider the tree is, the deeper its roots are."]],[2713,["Between Sahaja Yoga and work of other incarnations,"]],[2718,["there is one major difference."]],[2720,["The other incarnations had never worked in society before."]],[2725,["Nobody had got these powers."]],[2728,["It was not for the masses."]],[2730,["Only one or two people had attained this power."]],[2733,["Like King Janaka who gave Realisation to Nachiketa."]],[2736,["But now you all have got this power."]],[2739,["Now just grow in such a manner that you do not need anything else."]],[2745,["You can cure yourself, you can cure others."]],[2749,["You can understand Sahaja Yoga. You have everything you need."]],[2752,["But even now your attention is wandering."]],[2755,["I do not understand, what are you running after?"]],[2758,["You have still not grasped this."]],[2761,["In Sahaja Yoga, for everyone there is nothing but blessings."]],[2764,["You will not have any shortage of anything."]],[2769,["That is if you contribute to something in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2772,["Even if you do not work, you will get blessings."]],[2774,["Whoever I see, his business increased or career progressed,"]],[2778,["this or that worked out for him."]],[2781,["Everyone is continously receiving something or the other."]],[2785,["There was no sacrifice needed."]],[2787,["On the other hand, let me tell you"]],[2790,["when the freedom struggle in India happened,"]],[2793,["even we were troubled so much."]],[2796,["made to lie down on ice, given electric shocks."]],[2799,["My father and mother went to jail so many times. Our house was sold."]],[2804,["We started living in a hut... our cars were also sold."]],[2806,["We sacrified so much. You do not have to do anything like that."]],[2811,["But it should not be only receiving all the time."]],[2815,["You need to give as well."]],[2816,["If one door is open,"]],[2819,["you should open another one as well."]],[2822,["Keeping only one door open does not make the air flow."]],[2824,["Everyone tells Me that \"I received this blessing or that blessing\"."]],[2827,["What benevolence have you done to others?"]],[2832,["We must pay attention to this aspect:"]],[2834,["\"What benevolent action did we do?\"."]],[2839,["But there are many fights for leadership."]],[2842,["Who will be the leader? Many big fights."]],[2845,["There is a readymade platform so people want to lead."]],[2848,["You should know that all this is Mother's play."]],[2851,["You will not know the day that you fall from there."]],[2855,["Specially women should not get involved in leadership politics."]],[2859,["They will fall from the top to the bottom immediately."]],[2862,["And men should also understand, that there is no leader as such."]],[2867,["This is a game made by Mother and do not get entangled in this."]],[2871,["So I said that, \"Let the leaders come forward\". Leaders of what?"]],[2874,["All this is a game made by the Mother."]],[2877,["There are no leaders."]],[2879,["This is just a test of your wisdom."]],[2883,["If you ego rises due to leadership, then you are gone."]],[2887,["It will be revealed immediately."]],[2889,["In Sahaja Yoga nothing is hidden. Everything is exposed."]],[2894,["Even if I say something or not,"]],[2897,["they will expose their faces by themselves, on their own."]],[2901,["He says, \"I am the leader\" - and tomorrow he will shame himself. Why?"]],[2905,["They say that they did this bad thing."]],[2907,["So the leader has greater responsibility"]],[2911,["to be better, sweet, humble and loving than others"]],[2916,["and taking everyone along, consulting them and moving forward."]],[2921,["Now on the auspicious occasion of Shri Rama special day today,"]],[2925,["we should pray for all qualities demonstrated in His life."]],[2930,["If you can do only even a fraction of what He did,"]],[2933,["your Mother's life would be most worthwhile."]],[2936,["He was in exile in the jungle for so many days."]],[2939,["He wandered in jungles barefeet, did so much hard work."]],[2947,["And He did this just to obey the order of His father."]],[2951,["Now to obey Me, you need not to go into the forest for exile."]],[2955,["Nor to be barefeet or go hungry. Nothing at all."]],[2959,["Everything is ok."]],[2960,["But in Sahaja Yoga, you must know how to cure people"]],[2964,["and their diseases."]],[2967,["And you should have complete knowledge about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2970,["and most importantly you should know,"]],[2973,["that Sahaja Yoga is love."]],[2975,["It is the power of love that is working things out and no one else."]],[2979,["Because of that power, everyone can prosper."]],[2983,["This is not for one person"]],[2985,["or for any special people."]],[2989,["This is neither for any one country"]],[2992,["but for the whole world."]],[2997,["We should see also is how our attention is and where does it go."]],[3001,["If again and again it wanders, we should restrain it, stop it."]],[3006,["Fill the power of Spirit in your attention."]],[3009,["And a person should do every task with unwavering attention."]],[3013,["The person who will do this with devotion and love,"]],[3017,["will go very deep."]],[3020,["Or if not, there is anyways a lot of rubbish around."]],[3027,["And you know how garbage is finally disposed off."]],[3032,["So if you want to become garbage"]],[3035,["and you feel that you are very special,"]],[3037,["you are very good and can do this or that..."]],[3040,["First thing is humility,"]],[3043,["not only towards Me but towards everyone."]],[3046,["Talk humbly and with love."]],[3050,["You will see how an ordinary human, who is useless,"]],[3055,["can blossom like a lotus in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3059,["And his fragrance spreads in all four direction."]],[3061,["People come and tell Me immediately,"]],[3063,["\"Mother, he is a wonderful person, he is indeed like this\"."]],[3067,["Like that you should work."]],[3070,["Like people say about Maryada Purushottama that He was wonderful,"]],[3073,["similarly they will say about you."]],[3075,["The biggest thing is that for Me, you are the temple of Shri Rama"]],[3078,["and you have to develop this temple within you."]],[3081,["Let it be worshipped. Take care of it."]],[3084,["Watch it and live with your self-esteem intact."]],[3087,["Take the full benefit"]],[3094,["of your Self-Realization."]],[3097,["Along with that, you must have full respect and devotion towards it."]],[3101,["You should think, \"Now we are realized. How can we do this?\""]],[3105,["\"We are yogis. We cannot do this."]],[3107,["This cannot be done by us as this is wrong.\""]],[3109,["You will see that you will receive blessings immediately,"]],[3114,["immediately, at that time."]],[3116,["People are calling me Rokhra (money) Devi,"]],[3119,["as they decide something and money come in for that."]],[3122,["So many results, so much benefits everyone is getting."]],[3126,["Now based on your blessings, pass them to the world as well."]],[3132,["Like Shri Rama used all His powers for the benevolence of people"]],[3139,["and for the world to see an ideal man,"]],[3142,["the embodiment of an ideal man."]],[3146,["Whenever this occurs inside us, you will be surprised,"]],[3150,["what level you will reach."]],[3153,["You should not have any disease left. All diseases should go away."]],[3157,["Clear off everything. All bad habits should be dropped."]],[3161,["Eat what is needed, talk as much as needed."]],[3165,["Witness everything"]],[3168,["and for this you must look inward."]],[3170,["You should have a perceptive mind and introspect,"]],[3176,["that is looking inside yourself,"]],[3178,["looking inside yourself -"]],[3180,["\"antar nirikshan\" (internal inspection)."]],[3182,["Keep on watching, \"What am I doing? Why am I doing this or that?"]],[3186,["What should I be doing?"]],[3188,["There is no need for this. I am a Sahaja Yogi. Why am I doing this?"]],[3191,["Where is my mind going? Stop it.\""]],[3194,["By doing this all the time, you will get into meditation."]],[3198,["And on its own, your Kundalini will be pleased with this"]],[3201,["and bless you with a lot of contentment,"]],[3204,["that you will say, \"Mother, what a blessing I have received!\""]],[3207,["But only when you jump into it, you know what it is."]],[3212,["Jumping into it is the only small bit of hard work."]],[3216,["Shri Rama was born at midnight,"]],[3220,["so I had said, \"Let's have the Puja at leisure\". So that's how it is."]],[3223,["In Shri Rama's Puja, there is not much work"]],[3226,["as is not very elaborate or long."]],[3230,["But there is certainly something to understand,"]],[3232,["because He was in human form,"]],[3235,["so being in human form,"]],[3237,["He represents the humanity within us"]],[3244,["through which we understand the world,"]],[3246,["through which our intellect, our interest and our thoughts"]],[3252,["get changed."]],[3254,["All these things are Shri Rama."]],[3257,["Only through Him, can our ideas change."]],[3261,["Only through Him, can our nature change"]],[3265,["because He is our ideal."]],[3268,["Only after achieving Him as an ideal,"]],[3270,["you can reach other higher ideals"]],[3273,["as He was the ideal human being."]],[3275,["It is such a big thing,"]],[3277,["that God decided to come to this world in a human form"]],[3280,["to became our ideal."]],[3281,["He went through all hardships and adversity,"]],[3285,["to show us that despite any adversity,"]],[3289,["a person should not abandon his Dharma."]],[3291,["You should not leave the path of Vishwa Dharma"]],[3293,["and maintain your state of yoga."]],[3297,["My unending blessings to you all."]]]);
